<view class="page" wx:if="{{order}}">
  <view class="head">
    <view class="badge">{{statusLabel || '点餐清单'}}</view>
    <view class="head-title">{{order.title}}</view>
    <view class="head-meta">
      <text wx:if="{{mealDate}}">{{mealDate}} · </text>共 {{order.items.length}} 道 · {{timeText}}
    </view>
    <view class="head-id muted">单号 {{order.id}}</view>
    <view class="head-note" wx:if="{{order.note}}">{{order.note}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="item" wx:for="{{order.items}}" wx:key="index">
    <view class="item-idx">{{index + 1}}</view>
    <view class="item-body">
      <view class="item-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="item-sub">
        <text class="pill" wx:if="{{item.categoryLabel}}">{{item.categoryLabel}}</text>
        <text class="muted" wx:if="{{item.placeLabel}}">{{item.placeLabel}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <button class="btn-primary btn-block share-btn" open-type="share">分享给家人</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost btn-block" bindtap="copyText">复制清单文字</button>
    <button class="btn-danger btn-block" bindtap="onDelete">删除此单</button>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    点「分享给家人」转发微信卡片；家人打开即可看到清单（数据在链接里，无需云端）。
    开发者工具里分享能力有限，真机预览更准。也可先「复制清单文字」发微信。
  </view>
</view>

<view class="page empty" wx:else>
  <view class="muted">清单不存在或已删除</view>
</view>
